WEBVTT

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.160
How long until that ambulance gets here?

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:24.870
Get me more towels, damn it!

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:28.500
Irene- <i>san</i> , the ambulance is almost here.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.250
Hang in there...

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:35.870
The ambulance is here!

00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:37.040
Jack...

00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:37.040
The ambulance is here!

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:38.830
Jack...

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:38.830
Hurry!

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:40.000
What did you say?

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.080
Move! Get out of the way!

00:00:48.450 --> 00:00:50.160
Irene- <i>san</i> ...

00:00:54.910 --> 00:00:58.580
What was Irene- <i>san</i> trying to tell me?

00:02:35.790 --> 00:02:37.950
Irene's dead? You're joking!

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:39.160
"Now Hiring Psychics"

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:39.160
Irene's dead? You're joking!

00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:42.370
"Now Hiring Psychics"

00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:42.370
I wish I was...

00:02:44.950 --> 00:02:48.910
The body's being held by the East Side police.

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:53.660
Jack was after her because of that USB drive.

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:55.410
Why would Jack want the drive?

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:58.290
No clue...

00:02:58.290 --> 00:03:01.700
I'm sorry, but give me some time alone.

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:10.910
So there was something a lot worse

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:13.540
than pics of Ward Mayor Moran's
dick on that USB drive.

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:18.120
Wait, wasn't Jack the one
who killed Moran's daughter?

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:20.620
Alexandra, right?

00:03:20.620 --> 00:03:21.750
"Ward Mayor Moran's Daughter Murdered!
Was it Jack the Ripper?"

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:24.950
"Ward Mayor Moran's Daughter Murdered!
Was it Jack the Ripper?"

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:24.950
Do you think the Ward Mayor was trying to find out

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:28.160
"Ward Mayor Moran's Daughter Murdered!
Was it Jack the Ripper?"

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:28.160
who Jack was so he could get revenge?

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:32.410
And then he hid the information on the drive?

00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:34.620
It's the opposite, probably.

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:37.450
He got the info on Jack first,

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:39.410
and that's why Jack went after his daughter?

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:42.410
This is getting way too complicated!

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:48.620
Either way, the drive is the key
to unlocking Jack's identity.

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:51.450
Then we need to start analyzing it now!

00:03:51.450 --> 00:03:53.080
Where is it?

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:54.950
I couldn't say.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:02.080
Irene...

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:05.120
So you still had it, huh?

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:11.500
Yeah. She'd entrusted it to me.

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:18.750
I'll get the person who did this, I swear.

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:24.620
Um...

00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:27.500
You haven't eaten anything
since yesterday, right?

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:29.700
Should I make something?

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:31.790
I'm not hungry.

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:36.160
But you need to eat.
I'll add in some canned peaches...

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:40.250
Yes?

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:42.870
Huh?

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:48.910
This scent... it's rose.

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:55.160
Give me some time alone.

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:08.200
Who is Jack, really?

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:14.660
It's impossible...

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:24.500
Hey, perfect timing, mister!

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:30.370
Kabukin's head flew off into a nearby building.

00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:32.450
What kind of game were you playing?

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:35.910
Kick the Kabukin!

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:37.450
Let's go get it together!

00:05:37.450 --> 00:05:38.950
Let's go!

00:05:43.790 --> 00:05:48.370
This place is... atmospheric.

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:50.790
Go get it yourself.

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:52.700
You're not coming with me?

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:53.950
Nope, I'm not.

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:55.160
Nope!

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:58.080
Please, Watson!

00:06:05.910 --> 00:06:07.950
Anybody home?

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:20.950
They said it went through a window
on the second floor, right?

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:04.540
There it is!

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:16.370
Watson.

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:22.830
So I said...

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:24.870
Did you find Kabukin?

00:07:24.870 --> 00:07:27.290
Huh? What's gotten into him?

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:42.000
What the hell was that?

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:45.750
What are you doing?

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:47.620
Moriarty?

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:51.250
What's wrong? You're dead pale.

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:53.500
See a ghost?

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:56.200
No way...

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:59.330
I'm gonna go get a drink.

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:10.830
Hey, John.

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:14.290
"Piglet Club"

00:08:16.790 --> 00:08:18.700
I owe you one.

00:08:18.700 --> 00:08:20.040
After that, Maki and I went.

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:20.700
"Piglet Club"

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:20.700
After that, Maki and I went.

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:21.290
"Piglet Club"

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:21.290
Went where?

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:22.580
Went where?

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:24.500
To the end of the world!

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:27.500
I wish you could see it.

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:29.410
I see.

00:08:31.790 --> 00:08:34.160
I heard about Irene.

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:35.790
I'm sorry.

00:08:35.790 --> 00:08:37.950
Yeah.

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:44.580
But no amount of regret for the
departed will bring them back.

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:53.500
All we can do is carry on
the war that they left for us.

00:08:54.540 --> 00:08:58.790
Carry on, huh?

00:08:58.790 --> 00:09:04.450
Yes! I'm gonna catch Jack the Ripper,
get the reward and the fame,

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:08.160
and then go to the West Side
and marry Maki there!

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:11.370
We'll live the happy life
that Irene no longer can!

00:09:11.370 --> 00:09:13.910
That's what she would want!

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:16.080
That's definitely wrong.

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:40.540
Watson!

00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:50.580
Irene- <i>san</i> ?

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:59.700
What were you trying to tell me?

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:05.580
Moriarty was the one who...

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:09.950
Are you saying it was Moriarty who killed you?

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:13.750
At this rate, Sherlock will...

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:17.870
Huh?

00:10:32.950 --> 00:10:35.870
Sherlock, are you still down?

00:10:35.870 --> 00:10:38.250
Want to play <i>rakugo</i> poker?

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:41.410
I don't feel like it now.

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:43.040
Lame.

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:56.120
It's impossible!

00:10:56.120 --> 00:11:00.450
So, where'd you hide that USB drive?

00:11:00.450 --> 00:11:02.330
I'm so worried about it.

00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:06.870
Jack already came into this room once.

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:09.200
I know! Why don't I hang onto it?

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:10.830
No!

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:14.080
Why are you yelling?

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:20.040
Oh, well... If you have it,
Jack might come after you, right?

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:23.040
Well, maybe, but...

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.040
You're not going to answer?

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:32.290
No, I'll get the door.

00:11:40.370 --> 00:11:42.910
What are you doing?

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:46.870
It's rude to scream when you see someone.

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:52.660
Sherlock, you've got a visitor.

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:57.540
Stop hiding and talk to them.

00:11:57.540 --> 00:11:59.080
Bye.

00:12:02.790 --> 00:12:06.540
It's been a long time, my brother.

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:11.910
Detective Lestrade told me the situation.

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:17.330
He said that Irene Adler's body is being
held in the East Side Police Station.

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:23.200
Her autopsy will be held at Shinjuku
Medical University on the West Side.

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:25.290
Ward Mayor Moran gave the order personally.

00:12:25.290 --> 00:12:28.660
And you came here to tell me that?

00:12:28.660 --> 00:12:33.330
The two of you were very close, correct?

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:37.620
I thought you might be sad to know
someone was messing with her body.

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:42.290
You're very dear to me, my brother.

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:47.410
If you don't want someone messing
with her body, I'm willing to help you.

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:49.290
The drive?

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:50.700
You got it.

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:54.200
The drive you gave me
last time was a dummy, right?

00:12:56.200 --> 00:13:01.200
Don't worry. I told Ward Mayor Moran
that we're still recovering the data.

00:13:01.200 --> 00:13:03.200
You want to pull one over on him?

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:09.250
Don't be rude. I'm his loyal servant.

00:13:09.250 --> 00:13:11.750
You can't have the drive.

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:17.120
But once I have the password,
I'll share the information with you.

00:13:17.120 --> 00:13:25.250
Very well. Find the information on
the drive as soon as possible, my brother.

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:32.620
Tell Moran that Irene's body and
belongings were already incinerated.

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:34.450
Understood.

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:42.700
Are you sure it was okay
to make a deal like that?

00:13:42.700 --> 00:13:47.540
I'm not letting anyone have
their way with her but me.

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:50.120
Sherlock...

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:56.120
Hey, didn't you work at Shinjuku Medical?

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:58.250
What was your case?

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:00.700
Oh, well...

00:14:01.910 --> 00:14:06.330
Six months ago, I did
an autopsy for a certain girl.

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:09.450
Her name was Alexandra Moran.

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:11.200
Moran's daughter.

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:12.750
Yes.

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:18.660
I found what looked like some
kind of sticker stuck in her hair.

00:14:18.660 --> 00:14:24.370
Boss Kaneko told me recently that it
was actually a miniaturized transmitter.

00:14:24.370 --> 00:14:27.200
I told my boss about it, and...

00:14:28.330 --> 00:14:32.540
Right that after that,
strange things started happening.

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:35.450
I eventually started to feel
like I was in danger...

00:14:35.450 --> 00:14:40.290
So with Boss Kaneko's help,
I got over the wall.

00:14:43.830 --> 00:14:49.250
He told me that if I went to you for help,

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:51.410
you'd make it so I could be safe

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:51.410
It's strange, though.

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:53.410
on the West Side again.

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:53.410
What is?

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:57.790
Moran wants Irene's body at Shinjuku Medical.

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:01.580
But now my life here is...

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:01.580
And that's where Watson found

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:03.040
Oops!

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:03.040
the transmitter on his daughter

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:04.750
I left the door open.

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:04.750
the transmitter on his daughter

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:06.160
Alexandra's body,

00:15:06.160 --> 00:15:08.040
only to end with his life in danger.

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:10.410
It just seems strange.

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:12.330
A half-eaten can of peaches?

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:14.080
Don't touch that.

00:15:15.290 --> 00:15:17.080
Why?

00:15:21.290 --> 00:15:23.120
Let me be alone.

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:26.080
Again?

00:15:31.250 --> 00:15:33.500
Hey, it's Watson!

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:39.540
Why didn't you get Kabukin for us yesterday?

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:41.620
Oh, sorry.

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:43.290
Well, you see...

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:46.910
Yoshio! You're okay now?

00:15:46.910 --> 00:15:48.330
I heard you were in an accident.

00:15:48.330 --> 00:15:51.290
Huh? No I wasn't.

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:54.830
My family went on a trip
and I just got back this morning.

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:56.540
A trip?

00:15:56.540 --> 00:15:58.950
Yup! We won a raffle!

00:15:58.950 --> 00:16:01.000
We went to Atami and had a great time!

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:02.910
I'm so jealous...

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:13.830
The scent of roses?

00:16:13.830 --> 00:16:15.660
Watson!

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:17.830
Irene- <i>san</i> ?

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:21.410
Stop Moriarty...

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:23.620
Stop Moriarty!

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:27.660
Stop Moriarty!

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:27.660
Moriarty! Moriarty! Moriarty!

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:42.040
So what is it you wanted
to talk to me about alone?

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:50.290
You're Jack the Ripper, right, Moriarty?

00:16:52.500 --> 00:16:55.910
On the day Sherlock's room
was raided by Jack the Ripper,

00:16:55.910 --> 00:17:00.700
you said Yoshio- <i>kun</i> had gotten into
an accident and split up from the group.

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:02.870
But that was a lie.

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:06.870
You were there to look for
the USB drive, weren't you?

00:17:06.870 --> 00:17:11.540
Moriarty, no... Jack the Ripper!

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:14.200
No, no.

00:17:14.200 --> 00:17:16.330
That's not funny, Watson!

00:17:16.330 --> 00:17:19.120
What are you talking about?

00:17:19.120 --> 00:17:22.410
Wait, are you serious?

00:17:22.410 --> 00:17:24.000
If you're saying I'm wrong,

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:27.700
then tell me what it is
you were really doing there?

00:17:32.450 --> 00:17:35.370
Everybody, get this!

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:39.450
Moriarty is Jack?

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:41.500
What's wrong with you, John?

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:44.120
Nah, no way.

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:45.160
Right?

00:17:45.160 --> 00:17:48.250
But Irene- <i>san</i> just...

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:52.250
Poor guy.

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:55.660
So much has happened lately
you've gone a little crazy.

00:17:55.660 --> 00:17:57.410
No!

00:17:57.410 --> 00:17:58.450
It's true...

00:17:58.450 --> 00:18:00.580
Go to your room and get some rest.

00:18:00.580 --> 00:18:02.540
No, I...

00:18:02.540 --> 00:18:06.870
I believe the man they call John!

00:18:06.870 --> 00:18:08.120
Kyogoku- <i>san</i> !

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:11.080
Gokkun, give me a break!

00:18:11.080 --> 00:18:14.750
Um, if Kyogoku- <i>san</i> thinks it's true, so do I.

00:18:15.950 --> 00:18:17.910
Thank you, Maki.

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:19.500
For believing in me.

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:21.500
Of course.

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:21.500
Ridiculous.

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:23.040
My love!

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:27.540
Well, everyone makes mistakes.
Don't let it get you down.

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:28.830
Bye!

00:18:37.870 --> 00:18:39.700
"Shinjuku Ward East Side
Police Station"

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:42.160
"Shinjuku Ward East Side Police Station"

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:10.160
What are you doing?

00:19:14.200 --> 00:19:16.620
He can't be Jack.

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:18.910
I thought so, too!

00:19:18.910 --> 00:19:24.000
But when Irene- <i>san</i> was attacked,
he was there in the building!

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:27.500
Because I told him where it was.

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:29.870
He can be trusted.

00:19:29.870 --> 00:19:31.410
But...

00:19:31.410 --> 00:19:35.500
If anything, are you connected to Jack?

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:40.000
The only ones who knew where Irene was
were me, Moriarty, and you.

00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:41.830
You can't be serious!

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:44.410
Never let me see you again.

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:53.370
So that's what happened?

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:54.500
Yes.

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:57.500
I don't know what to do now.

00:19:57.660 --> 00:19:58.580
"Luxury Retirement Home
Oshidori Gardens"

00:19:58.580 --> 00:20:00.580
"Luxury Retirement Home
Oshidori Gardens"

00:19:58.580 --> 00:20:00.580
It's simple.

00:20:00.580 --> 00:20:04.080
"Luxury Retirement Home
Oshidori Gardens"

00:20:00.580 --> 00:20:04.080
Get the data from the drive
and you can prove Jack is Moriarty.

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:06.870
Get the data from the drive
and you can prove Jack is Moriarty.

00:20:06.870 --> 00:20:09.120
Is that possible?

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:11.080
I have connections.

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:15.200
Get me the drive, and I can get it cracked.

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:16.750
But...

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:18.790
What? Are you scared?

00:20:18.790 --> 00:20:21.750
No, that's not it...

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:26.040
Are you going to allow another friend to die?

00:20:26.040 --> 00:20:28.450
Like you did with Irene?

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:36.540
I told you...

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:41.830
All we can do is carry on...

00:20:41.830 --> 00:20:45.910
...the war that they left for us, huh?

00:20:47.410 --> 00:20:49.950
Okay. I'll do it.

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:06.160
Okay.

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:09.660
"World Map"

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:15.500
It's not here.

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:17.080
Wait, I know!

00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:26.950
There it is.

00:21:34.200 --> 00:21:36.080
Kyogoku- <i>san</i> .

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:37.540
The drive?

00:21:37.540 --> 00:21:39.370
I've got it.

00:21:39.370 --> 00:21:42.750
Um... Can you really crack the password?

00:21:42.750 --> 00:21:44.700
I told you. Yes!

00:21:44.700 --> 00:21:47.120
Now give it to me.

00:21:47.120 --> 00:21:49.250
What's wrong? Give it to me!

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:53.000
Wait! Calm down!

00:21:53.000 --> 00:21:53.950
Kyogoku- <i>san</i> !

00:21:53.950 --> 00:21:56.370
Hand it over!

00:22:00.080 --> 00:22:02.330
Hand it over.

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:06.250
I'll be the one to track down Jack!

00:22:06.250 --> 00:22:08.500
Wait, was it you?

00:22:18.660 --> 00:22:21.540
Well done, Watson.

00:23:59.790 --> 00:24:00.120
"Jack the Ripper"

